{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Validate the new programmatic timing values.** A timeout of `NaN` or infinity makes the deadline comparison permanently false, so missing expectations or direct retrieval can poll forever despite the advertised maximum. A zero, negative, or `NaN` interval can busy-loop or fail in `sleep`. Reject non-finite values, require timeout to be nonnegative (preserving the tested zero-timeout behavior), and require the interval to be finite and positive.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx8772M5v","finding_digest":"907a915b5f825471c1584e3a30893648b71f7f53c373335caaeff12fcc697cfc","finding_id":"arf_v1_sb5jcw27qjkhdqkyjy5dbcjwjc","finding_key":"cloudwatch.py::cloudwatchlogretriever-init::invalid-timing-bounds","identity_key":"cloudwatch.py::cloudwatchlogretriever-init::invalid-timing-bounds","line":152,"observation_digest":"39d2def5ac0f2c70bf92607f173a99df55cf258c6dc9c5e9bfc840659daf1ede","observation_id":"aro_v1_hhjn55nmb4whbp4smb7roouz35","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/cloudwatch.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T23:49:31Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zyao5t7v6xbb44jqjsebcumcrh","reviewed_base_sha":"bb0c475d6cb238407619f58d5176ed48db7c8ae6","reviewed_head_sha":"74a64ddc1c1351dcfcdd18b6a3f72eb1fc52edbc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":149,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":120},"record_id":"art_v1_4j5zasen7qttyiktopfeput2ru","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T23:49:31Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
